    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the critically acclaimed &quot;Tomboy Adventure!&quot; is finally here!   <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the middle of nowhere can have its benefits. Just you, the sea and ice cream from the vending machine up-hill. No one to bother you. Well, aside from this one girl that keeps showing up whether you want it or not...  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/40cbd216d0d4f511e78368a5c7d3d43a.poster.avif?t=1752087243\" width=606 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/40cbd216d0d4f511e78368a5c7d3d43a.webm?t=1752087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/40cbd216d0d4f511e78368a5c7d3d43a.mp4?t=1752087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/df40c011b51152ec918dbef52aef5d6a.webp?t=1752087243\" width=614 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomboy Adventure 2 is an interaction driven dating sim where through your choices you unsuccessfully try to romance your companion. Exploring the island unlocks new dialogue options, outfits and interactions, creating new opportunities for getting your feelings across. Perseverance is key! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/9cf08a98f041e2e80f587f7efa06beca.poster.avif?t=1752087243\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/9cf08a98f041e2e80f587f7efa06beca.webp?t=1752087243\" class=\"bb_img\" width=606 height=286 /></picture></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong> </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Branching dialogue </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Character editor </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Headpatting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Day/night cycle </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic weather </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Advanced headpatting </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Icecream! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Both VR and non-VR play is supported!  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/331cc0e2bad435aef8ccd894ebc37201.poster.avif?t=1752087243\" width=606 height=296 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/331cc0e2bad435aef8ccd894ebc37201.webm?t=1752087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/331cc0e2bad435aef8ccd894ebc37201.mp4?t=1752087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Summer is short so lets enjoy it! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/df40c011b51152ec918dbef52aef5d6a.webp?t=1752087243\" width=614 height=2 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A sequel to the critically acclaimed &quot;Tomboy Adventure!&quot; is finally here!   <br>   </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Living in the middle of nowhere can have its benefits. Just you, the sea and ice cream from the vending machine up-hill. No one to bother you. Well, aside from this one girl that keeps showing up whether you want it or not...  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/40cbd216d0d4f511e78368a5c7d3d43a.poster.avif?t=1752087243\" width=606 height=206 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/40cbd216d0d4f511e78368a5c7d3d43a.webm?t=1752087243\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/40cbd216d0d4f511e78368a5c7d3d43a.mp4?t=1752087243\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/df40c011b51152ec918dbef52aef5d6a.webp?t=1752087243\" width=614 height=2 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tomboy Adventure 2 is an interaction driven dating sim where through your choices you unsuccessfully try to romance your companion. Exploring the island unlocks new dialogue options, outfits and interactions, creating new opportunities for getting your feelings across. Perseverance is key! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><picture><source srcset=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/9cf08a98f041e2e80f587f7efa06beca.poster.avif?t=1752087243\" media=\"(prefers-reduced-motion: reduce)\"><img src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2896630/extras/9cf08a98f041e2e80f587f7efa06beca.webp?t=175